# Phase 11 Search, DB state "dirty" (docs/phase11-brief.md section 6
# item 10): after a power cut mid-commit the next boot rebuilds in the
# background; Search works from the last loaded database meanwhile (or
# says "Updating Library..." until one is loaded), and once the rebuilt
# database commits, the open Search reloads its rows (one
# lib_search_begin per commit, not per key) and its results stay.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p11-search-dirty.script
# needs: library
# golden: skip

wait 4000
wait_db 30000
dirty_db            # the power cut mid-commit
reboot

wait 2000
key SELECT          # Music
wait 800
wheel +8 300        # "Search"
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
type h
wait 600
shot during         # results, or Updating Library... while none is loaded
wait_db 45000
wait 2500           # the commit's new generation: rows reloaded
shot after          # Results for: h, rows
quit
